<section class="card"><h2>Paste an alert</h2><p class="muted">The current generic parser requires an explicit debit, purchase or payment marker and one LKR amount. It does not connect to your bank. Remove sensitive details if you prefer; keep the amount and transaction wording.</p><form method="post" action="/salary/alert-import/preview" class="stack"><?= csrf_field() ?><label>Message<textarea name="alert" rows="5" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="Your card was debited LKR 1,250.00 on 02/11/2026 at a shop."><?= e($alert) ?></textarea></label><button class="secondary">Preview alert</button></form><?php if ($error): ?><div class="notice" role="alert"><?= e($error) ?></div><?php endif; ?></section>
